{
  "work_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik",
  "source_path": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik.json",
  "source_language": "oge",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-31",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.4.1.s4",
      "source_sha256": "ac112cbfc034791a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The saint recognized his deceitful intent and guarded herself firmly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.4.4.s6",
      "source_sha256": "c109bb305a6e6ba9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We reported all this to the pitiakhsh. He grew angry at heart and raged against her."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.5.1.s1",
      "source_sha256": "e0dc7f45dea52fe5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then he sent Jojik, his brother, and Jojik's wife, his sister-in-law, and the bishop of his household, and said to them:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.5.2.s1",
      "source_sha256": "553351938c4e5feb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When they arrived, they went in before the queen and spoke many persuasive words to her. Then holy Shushanik said to them:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.5.4.s2",
      "source_sha256": "45b09ee87347a2b7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When she entered the palace, she did not sit in her own upper chamber, but in a small cell."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.6.1.s1",
      "source_sha256": "6f7635d53d6ccaee",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Two days later the wolf came to the palace and said to his servants:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.6.3.s2",
      "source_sha256": "81073d7137d2a454",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And because he begged so much, Varsken ordered that she be released, brought into a cell, and carefully guarded by a single servant,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.8.1.s1",
      "source_sha256": "e0a23c6ddb434b2e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "When the Great Fast arrived, the blessed Shushanik went to a place near the holy church, looked for a small cell, and shut herself up there."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.8.3.s1",
      "source_sha256": "fe4bffa29afee209",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "When the Monday of the Completion arrived and the pitiakhsh came back from the war against the Huns, the devil was digging at his heart."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.9.3.s2",
      "source_sha256": "189e6d6cf9d435fc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they raised their voices and wept, and tore their cheeks, and pitifully shed their tears for holy Shushanik."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.9.3.s6",
      "source_sha256": "94dfda0d94df0403",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when they reached the bridge of the fortress, the pitiakhsh said to holy Shushanik:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.9.4.s1",
      "source_sha256": "a5046e7bc0f61ced",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when they entered the fortress, they found a small room on the north side, small and dark, and there they put the saint."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.10.2.s1",
      "source_sha256": "6e7dbe3034b23db3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But I spoke to that guard with many entreaties and promised him a drinking vessel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.10.3.s3",
      "source_sha256": "90d9447f21293361",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And as he was greatly grieved, he ordered that she be released only from the bonds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.10.3.s7",
      "source_sha256": "63b07fedcf7bc3b6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "She made that whole fortress bright and beautiful with that spiritual harp."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.12.3.s1",
      "source_sha256": "50f5cca20722f42e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And I went and saw the holy Shushanik, wasted away and swollen from weeping."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.16.2.s1",
      "source_sha256": "81be355399feb7d1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then, when Jojik perceived that the saint would depart from this flesh that day, he said:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.17.2.s1",
      "source_sha256": "12702d29fd79d667",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And all those bishops and nobles together made one request of her:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-hagiography/coll-hag-1/martyrdom-of-shushanik#Shush.20.1.s4",
      "source_sha256": "7e5dc8cdbba25830",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-31",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "And it was a Thursday, the day on which we established the commemoration of Saint Shushanik, to the glory and praise of God,"
    }
  ]
}
